  { question: "Can I cancel my subscription anytime?", answer: "Yes. You can cancel at any time from your account settings. There are no long-term contracts." },
  { question: "Is this suitable for small teams only?", answer: "It’s designed for small and growing teams, but it scales as your team and client list grow." },
  { question: "How long does setup take?", answer: "Most teams are up and running in under five minutes. No complicated onboardin" },
